  message: "Foundation phase landed in PR #3803. scripts/check-schema-coverage runs hypergumbo against tests/fixtures/schema-coverage-corpus/ (10 fixture files, ~5s wall time) and asserts every canonical registry value appears in output, modulo baseline at .ci/schema-coverage-baseline.json. Ratchet mechanism: baseline shrinks via --update-baseline; positive delta in warning mode = CI fail. Initial baseline records 119 uncovered Symbol.kind, 44 uncovered Edge.type, 111 uncovered Edge.meta.evidence_type. Wired into verify-generated CI job. Side finding: Solidity emits kind='modifier' not in SYMBOL_KINDS — real axis-drift invisible to self-analysis; separate follow-up. Status stays in_progress — remaining WI-luzuh work (grow corpus, ratchet baseline, eventually promote to fail mode) is incremental."  # aa02
