  message: "INV-piroh retirement (2026-05-18): folded jsonschema conformance check into check-schema-coverage. Per-PR CI step drops from 3.5min (self-analysis) to ~5s (corpus). Conformance baseline starts empty; any future producer regression that introduces a schema violation loud-fails immediately. scripts/check-schema-conformance and .ci/schema-conformance-baseline.json retire. Coverage ratchet path unchanged — corpus continues growing toward 0-baseline state, after which the gate flips to --mode=fail."  # 2bfb
